        "number": 1,
        "marks": 10,
        "text": "A Basic 9 group at Nkoranza caught an insect in a grassy field near their school farm and drew it carefully. Fig. 1 shows their drawing with some of the parts lettered.\n\n\n\n*Fig. 1: An adult insect collected from a grassy field.*\n\n**(a)** Name the parts labelled **P**, **Q**, **R** and **S**.\n\n**(b)** State the function of the part labelled **T** and the function of the antennae.\n\n**(c)** Give **two** features shown in Fig. 1 which show that the animal is an insect.\n\n**(d)** Name the type of mouth parts this insect has, and state how these mouth parts affect a farmer's crop.\n\n---"
