        "text": "A Basic 9 class carried out a study of grasshoppers on two plots of the school farm. Plot A was weeded clean every week; plot B was left with its weeds. The pupils counted the grasshoppers seen in ten minutes on each plot in three months.\n\n| Month | Grasshoppers counted on plot A | Grasshoppers counted on plot B |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| May | 6 | 14 |\n| June | 4 | 23 |\n| July | 3 | 31 |\n\n**(a)** Draw a simple labelled diagram of the **life cycle of the grasshopper**. Show the three stages, label each of them and use arrows to show the order in which they follow one another.\n\n**(b)** Study the table above.\n\n(i) On which plot did the number of grasshoppers rise, and by how many from May to July?  **[2 marks]**\n\n(ii) Explain the difference between the two plots.  **[1 mark]**\n\n(iii) State **one** conclusion the class can draw from the study.  **[1 mark]**\n\n---"
